        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You scramble the ability of the target to use language, causing them to speak in unintelligible tongues.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> For 1 round, the target's language becomes unintelligible, they're unable to communicate ideas with other creatures, and any action they take with the linguistic trait fails.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, and the target can't cast spells that require incantations for the duration. Spells with the subtle trait don't require incantations.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the duration is 1 minute.</p>"
